---
import DemoFrame from './DemoFrame.astro';
import GoWorkerPoolDemo from '../demos/GoWorkerPoolDemo.tsx';
---
<figure class="gwp-figure">
  <DemoFrame title="Worker pool: change the worker count and watch the queue" titleVi="Worker pool: đổi số worker và xem hàng đợi">
    <GoWorkerPoolDemo client:visible />
  </DemoFrame>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>A teaching model with one tick per 100 ms. The page opens on the result of a finished 5 second run. Pick 2 workers, 20 jobs per second and 200 ms per job: the pool can only finish 10 jobs per second, so the queue grows.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mô hình dạy học, mỗi tick là 100 ms. Trang mở sẵn ở kết quả của một lần chạy 5 giây. Chọn 2 worker, 20 job mỗi giây và 200 ms mỗi job: pool chỉ xong được 10 job mỗi giây nên hàng đợi dài ra.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style is:global>
  .gwp-figure { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gwp-figure > .demo-frame { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .gwp-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .gwp .sd-group > span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gwp .sd-stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)); }
  .gwp .sd-stat span { text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }
  .gwp-stage { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; margin: 12px 0; }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .gwp-stage { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .gwp-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; background: var(--bg); }
  .gwp-col small { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .gwp-queue, .gwp-workers { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; min-height: 30px; }
  .gwp-queue b { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gwp-cell { width: 14px; height: 22px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--gold); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); }
  .gwp-worker { width: 30px; height: 30px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--bg-alt); color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .gwp-worker.is-busy { border-color: var(--gold); background: var(--gold-tint-bg); color: var(--text); }
  .gwp-note { margin: 12px 0; padding: 8px 12px; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); background: var(--bg-alt); font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-body); }
  .gwp-tick { margin-left: auto; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; align-self: center; }
</style>
